  "notes_for_editor": "Elevation is not in facts: the Forest Service list gives 4,753 feet and marks it as Doris Butte's elevation, and Idaho Fire Lookouts shows question marks. Name: the list calls the site Doris Point (Butte). Location check done 2026-10-10: against Pierce's coordinates on Wikipedia (46.49583, -115.80111), the record point (46.56914, -115.41807) lies about 19 miles east-northeast of Pierce, which fits the two descriptions. The earlier 40-mile estimate was wrong. Staffing is left out: no source gives a staffing history."
